  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "policy",
      "title": "Configured quotas before routing",
      "items": [
        "Reference-application middleware checks atomic per-peer and aggregate quotas in shared protocol state before routing, body decoding or certificate extraction. Routes without configured quotas pass through.",
        "Quota exhaustion returns 429 with Retry-After; unavailable quota state returns 503. Every request carrier shown in the next stage belongs to an admitted request. The TLS handshake itself precedes HTTP middleware."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "transport",
      "title": "Two outputs from the transport",
      "items": [
        "The transport decodes a check-in message or command response and extracts the device certificate from an enabled identity source.",
        "Both check-in and command traffic reach Core with a decoded message and extracted identity. Configured certificate-status rejection returns 403 before hooks, replacement handling or ordinary dispatch."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "authentication",
      "title": "Identity sources",
      "items": [
        "Native TLS, a trusted proxy header, and Mdm-Signature are separate certificate sources. Header trust depends on the deployment boundary.",
        "The signature verifier uses the original body bytes. Status enforcement is separate from transport trust, proof of possession, pinning and account/enrollment authorization."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "service",
      "title": "Outbound validation",
      "items": [
        "Wire payload validation and target support checks apply to commands at enqueue and dispatch. They are separate from incoming check-in decoding."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "transport",
      "title": "Public documentation",
      "items": [
        "Check-in — https://developer.apple.com/documentation/devicemanagement/check-in",
        "RFC 9440 — Client-Cert HTTP Header Field — https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc9440",
        "MDM payload — https://developer.apple.com/documentation/devicemanagement/mdm",
        "Quota wrapper and shared state — https://github.com/deploymenttheory/go-apple-dm/blob/80599ddc35778bcc88fa2ac77bb1dc68a51cf089/server/internal/app/security.go",
        "Certificate status before service hooks — https://github.com/deploymenttheory/go-apple-dm/blob/80599ddc35778bcc88fa2ac77bb1dc68a51cf089/server/service/checkin.go"
      ]
    }
  ]
